<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id" />
  <para style="h">YONA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Yona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yona</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man poke ki ikom buk mukene pa lunebi ma kicoyogi matye i buk me Baibul maleng pa Lubanga. Pien en tito lok me ododo pa lanebi ma okwero winyo dog Rwot Lubangane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lubanga ceng ooro lanebi man me cito i Nineve ma en aye gangkal madit me lobo Aciria ma gin lukwor pa jone jo Icrael. Yona onongo pe mito cito kunu me tero lok me kwena man ma Rwot omiyo bote pi jo meno. En ongeyo ada ni Lubanga pe obiketo can me kinigane ikom lobo meno ki jo matye iye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Inge lwak jami me aura ma otime en dok oye me tero lok me kwena pa Lubanga bot jo magi kadi bed ni cwinye pe omaro loke wa acel. Yona otero lok me tyeko gang meno pi akemo madit pa Lubanga matye katuge ikom jo me lobo meno ikarenu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok me buk man bene tito pi dit pa Lubanga maloyo gigu ducu, kun en aye doro cwece ma en ocweyo kitwerone madit adada.</para>
  <para style="ip">I agikine onyutu kamaleng ni Lubanga obedo Lubanga me kica ki mar, man onen kuman ni ma ka tyeko jo ma jemo ikome en mito ni gunguti wek etim ki gin kica ka elargi kadi bed ni gin lukwor pa jone jo Icrael, ma ka miyogi pwod ki tyekogi woko ki i lobo ma en ocweyo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lwongo ki jemo pa Yona ikom Rwot <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nigonye ki ngut atika pa Yona <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me kwena ma Yona otito ikom jo Nineve <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kica pa Lubanga ikom jo Nineve <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yona oringo woko ki bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:25">2 Luk 14:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inino mo acel, Rwot Lubanga oloko ki Yona wod pa Amittai, kun waco ni, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“A icit Nineve, ma en tye taun maditi. Wek ecitit lok ikom jone, pi tim meggi maracu ma dong otyeko ngene wa bota.” <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Ento Yona oa me lwi woko ki inyim Rwot pi wot Tarcic. En ocito wa iwang wat me Jopa kama onongo mel ma cito Tarcic; ci oculu lim ma mite pi wot meno, ka ocako donyo i mel ci guwoto ki jo mogo ma ticigi terogi i nam madongo, me cito kwedgi i Tarcic, wek ea woko ki inyim Rwot.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Ento Rwot ocwalo yamo madwong tutwal i nam, omiyo pii me nam otwage matek tutwal, ma mel onongo dong cok tur. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Cutcut lukwang mel, gudoko lwor omiyo dano acel acel ocako kok bot lubangane, kun gibolo jami ma onongo tye i mel woko i nam, wek mel odong mayot. Ento Yona ocito mere wa i gul mel kama obutu piny i iye, ci onino kunu matek. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Ci ladit me mel obino bote ci openye ni, “Itye katimo gin ango? Itye kanino anina? A malo wek ileg lubangani! Gwok nyo lubangani bitamo pirwa miyo pe wato.”<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Ci lukwang mel guloko keken gi kun giwaco ni, “Kong wabolu wunu kwir, wek wange anga ma oweko gin marac man opoto ikomwa.” Gubolo kwir, ci kwir opoto ikom Yona. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Ci guwaco ni, “Tit ki wan, anga ma oweko gin marac kuman opoto ikomwa? Tici tic ango? In ia kikwene? Loboni kilwongo ningo? In idano me rok mene?” <verse eid="JON 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Ci Yona ogamo doggi ni, “An Laibru; alworo Rwot Lubanga me polo, ma oketo nam ki lobo.” <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Ci lworo omako jonu matek tutwal, omiyo gupenye ni, “Man gin ango ma itimoni?” Pien jonu onongo gungeyo ni en tye karingo woko wek elwi ki inyim Rwot, pien onongo en kong otito ki gin.<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Ka dok guwace ni, “Man watim gin ango ikomi, wek nami ojuke okwe mot pirwa.” Pien nam onongo tinge mede ameda. <verse eid="JON 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />En ogamo doggi ni, “Wun wutinga, wubola woko i nam, ka wek nam okwe pirwu; pien angeyo ni twage me nam man matek tutwali obino ikomwu pi an.” <verse eid="JON 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Kadi bed kumeno jonu gukwango mel matek me dok cen iwi tera, ento pe gutwero meno, pien twage me nam obedo ka mede ameda ikomgi. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Pimeno omiyo gukok bot Rwot Lubanga kun giwaco ni, “Wabako dogwa boti, in Rwot Lubanga, pe iwek wato ka waneko laco man, pe imii remo pa ngat ma pe ki bal odok iwiwa; pien in Rwot Lubanga dong ityeko timo kit macalo i mito.” <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Ci gutingo Yona, ci gubole woko i nam, omiyo twage me nam otugi kwe woko licwic. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Man omiyo jonu gulworo Rwot Lubanga tutwal; dok gumiyo mot me gitum bot Rwot kun gilubu kit kwong ma gukwongo me tiyo bote.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat 12:40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento Rwot omiyo rec madit omwonyo Yona woko i iye; ci Yona orii i i rec meno pi nino adek dyeceng ki dyewor.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Yona olego Rwot Lubangane ki i irec <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">“Ceng akok bot Rwot i cana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">ci en ogamo doga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">ceng akok ki i lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">ci iwinyo dwona.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />In onongo ibola kamatut,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">i cwiny dye nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">pii ma mol oruma woko dyere;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">twage me pii ki corene omol okato ki iwiya.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Ka dok atamoni, onongo kiryema woko ki inyimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:4">dok bene pe abineno ot meri maleng ningning.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Pii omwonya woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">kut matut oruma dyere;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">ci tiro okade woko iwiya.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Alwiny piny ite godi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Alor acito piny wa i lobo ca, kama kiloro dog gange iwiya woko matwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Ento in i Rwot Lubangana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">idwoko kwona nia ki i bur.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Ka kwona onongo tye ka a woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">ci dong apo ikom Rwot:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">ci legana owinye boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">i Ot meri maleng.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Jo ma giworo cal jogi mamwani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:8">gikwero bedo luwiny boti.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Ento an abimiyi gitum mera ki dwon me pwoc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">gin ma dong atyeko kwongo pire bene abicobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">Lar a ki bot Rwot.”<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Ci Rwot oloko ki rec, ci rec ongoko Yona woko iwi tera.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yona owinyo dog Rwot ocito Nineve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Lacen Rwot dok oloko bot Yona pi tyen me aryone, kun waco ni, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />“A icit Nineve ma en gang maditi, ci icit itit iye lok ma aciki pire.” <verse eid="JON 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Ci Yona oa ocito Nineve, kit macalo Rwot owace. Nineve onongo taun madit tutwal, ma ngolo dyere arii keken teri i wot me nino adek. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat 12:41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk 11:23</ref></char></note>Yona ocako donyo i taun madit meno, wote otere nino acel, ka odange kun waco ni, “Odong nino pyere angwen, ci Nineve gibiketo woko liweng.” <verse eid="JON 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Ci jo ducu me Nineve guye Lubanga; ka dok guciko bene pi kare me rii kec, kun guruku bongo cola, cake ki ikom jo madongo, o kwede wa ikom jo matino.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Ka lok oo bot laloc me Nineve, ci en oa malo ki iwi komkere, ogonyo jore ki ikome, oruku bongo cola ka obedo kwede i buru. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Dok laloc man omiyo lok oket oromo i dye Nineve ducu ni, “Pi cik pa laloc me Nineve ki luditone, pe dano mo, kadi lee, kadi dyang, kadi romo, obil gin mo; pe gucam, dok pe gumat pii. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Ento wek dano ki lee kiumgi ki bongo cola, wek gukok matek bot Lubanga; i yo, wek ngat acel acel oloke owek kite maraci, ki bene timo tim aranyi ma en bedo katimone. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Anga ma ngeyo? Gwok nyo Lubanga bijuku cwinye, ci biloke weko kinigane mageri, wek pe wato!”<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Ka Lubanga oneno gin ma jo man gutiyo, kit ma guloke kwede, guweko tim meggi maracu, Lubanga ojuku cwinye ikom gin marac ma onongo nene en owaco ni ebitimo ikomgi, ci pe dong otiyo.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kiniga pa Yona ki kica pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Kit ma Lubanga oloko ki tame ikom lwak me taun meno maditi, owango i Yona matek, omiyo kiniga omake adada. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Nia 34:6</ref></char></note>Ci Yona dok olego Rwot Lubanga, kun owaco ni, “Akwayi, in Rwot, man pe en aye gin ma nene alworo ikare ma onongo pud atye i lobona? Meno en aye obedo gin ma omiyo alwi woko oyotoyot me cito Tarcic; pien angeyo ni in Lubanga ma lakica, dok maro dano, kiniga bene pe maki oyot, mar meri ma pe loke ni dwong, in lagen mada, dok ijuku cwinyi pi timo rac bot lwaki. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:4">Luk 19:4</ref></char></note>Koni dong in Rwot Lubanga, ikwany kwona woko ki ikoma, akwayi, pien bedo ber ka ato kato ma abedo kwo.” <verse eid="JON 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Ci Rwot ogame ni, “Itamo ni ber me in bedo ki kiniga?” <verse eid="JON 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Lacen Yona oa woko ki i Nineve, ci ocito ogero bolone me bedo kunu ki i tung kunyango me taun meno maditi; ci en obedo piny ite tipu bolone, wek kong enen gin ma bitime ikom taun man maditi.<verse eid="JON 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Ka dok Lubanga omiyo keno otwi odongo olak ka wi Yona, wek tipune ogeng ka wiye, pi kweyo ceng wek pe owange tutwal. Kumeno Yona cwinye obedo yom tutwal pi kenonu. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Ento ka piny oru nino mukene, ci Lubanga omiyo kwidi ocobo kenonu, ci oner woko. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Ikare ma ceng dong otuc, Lubanga omiyo yamo malyet okodo tutwal ki tung kunyango, ci ceng owango wi Yona nio ka kome oloc woko; omiyo Yona okwayo ni twora etoo, kun waco ni, “Bedo ber ka ato kato ma abedo kwo.” <verse eid="JON 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Ento Lubanga odok iye ki Yona ni, “Itamo ni ber me in bedo ki kiniga pi kenonu?” Yona ogamo ni, “Atamo ni ber me an bedo ki kiniga, kiniga ma roma to.” <verse eid="JON 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Rwot dok owaco ni, “Itye ka tamo pi keno ma in pe itiyo tic mo pireni, in aye pe imiyo odongo, ma otwi i dyewor acel ka dok oto woko i dyewor acel. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />An pe myero kica omaka pi Nineve ma en taun madit, matye iye jo makato alip miya acel ki pyere aryo ma pe gingeyo poko kin cinggi ma lacuc ki ma lacam, ki dok bene dyangi mapolgu?”<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>